It's been a rough
couple of years.

00:02:34.334 --> 00:02:35.701
-Yeah, exactly right.

00:02:35.701 --> 00:02:37.000
Make someone laugh.
Come on, why not?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.934
-Yeah, make yourself laugh.
-Yeah.

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:41.868
-You know, just give it
